    note: `Custom till and back-office development starts from ${P.software}, an online store or ordering channel beside the counter starts from ${P.shop}, a companion Android app for stock checks or a mobile till starts from ${P.app}, and automation that moves till data into other systems without a person retyping it starts from ${P.ai}. Those are starting points for scoped phases, not a licence fee, and the honest comparison is against a subscription POS where you pay per till per month forever and own nothing. Over three years a two-branch café is almost always better off subscribing; a fifteen-branch operator with a selling motion no product fits often is not. What moves our number is the count of distinct selling flows, how many payment and loyalty integrations are in scope, whether the receipt has to exist in Arabic as well as English, and how much of the back office you want rather than just the till. Everything is quoted as itemised lines in USD and nothing is billed before you approve the quote in writing; starting prices for every service sit on <a href='/pricing/'>our pricing page</a>.`,
